		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Prefetching makes navigating between routes feel instant. By default, Next.js prefetches routes based on the links in your application code."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "This guide explains how prefetching works, what Next.js prefetches for you, and how to control it:"
